Japan Trip Kit — licensing
==========================

This project ships two kinds of material under two different licenses.

1. DOCUMENTATION AND DATA — Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0
   International (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0)

   Covers: JAPAN-TRIP-KIT.md, everything under guides/, data/, catalog/ and examples/, this
   README, and any other prose, table, or dataset in the repository.

   In plain terms: you may copy, share, and adapt this material, including feeding it to an AI
   assistant, as long as you (a) credit the source, (b) do not use it commercially, and (c) release
   anything you build from it under the same terms.

   Full legal text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode
   Human-readable summary: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

   Attribution notice to reproduce when sharing or adapting:

     "Japan Trip Kit", licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.
     Inn research derived from the FlyerTalk thread "Japan Luxury Ryokans - A Primer +
     Impressions" and the reviews of its author, KI-NRT, and its members.

2. CODE — MIT License

   Covers: everything under builder/ (HTML, CSS and JavaScript, including index.html,
   route-builder-logic.js, route-data.js and serve.js) and any other script in the repository.

   Note that builder/route-data.js embeds trip data; the code in it is MIT, while the data it
   carries is CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 per section 1.

