Third-party material
--------------------

Neither license above grants rights in material owned by others:

- Photographs of inns and hotels belong to the properties. They are not redistributed here; the
  builder and the catalogue load them from https://ryokancatalog.com. Do not copy them out for
  other uses without the property's permission.
- Quoted and paraphrased forum content remains the work of its authors, principally KI-NRT and the
  members of the FlyerTalk ryokan thread, and is used here as commentary and reference.
- Restaurant information informed by Tabelog (https://tabelog.com) remains Tabelog's and its
  reviewers'. No Tabelog data is reproduced in bulk.
- Travel times cite public sources - railway operators, japan-guide, and the properties' own access
  pages - which are linked inline rather than reproduced.
